  "description": "Single storey rear extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive rearward projection, would result in an obtrusive form of development, which would have an unacceptable impact on the neighbouring amenities of No.3 and No. 7 The Highway, in terms of overshadowing, loss of outlook and overbearing presence, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D(7) of The London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and GR1 of the Draft Harrow Local plan 2021-2041.&lt;/p&gt;"
